Develop a premium, modern, responsive hospitality website and reservation management platform for D'Calabash Hotel, located in Congo Town Back Road, Monrovia, Liberia.

The website must represent two primary business operations:

1. Hotel accommodation and guest services.
2. Restaurant, dining and food services.

Both operations must be fully integrated into one website with separate reservation workflows and a shared administrative backend.

This is a production-oriented project, not a static demonstration website.

The application must have a functional frontend, connected Supabase database, authentication, image storage, administrative dashboard and working reservation workflows.

